        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ūyo atatogilwe kūlekana na shibi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangī gwakumūkile na gwa gīkī būlīho būjingi ū mu bing'we; nīyo būjingi ūbo būtīmo nūūlū ū mu banhū abo bataamanile Mulungu, gīkī munhū kūnsola nina ng'wīnga! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibūlī mukwikumīlījaga, aho yalī īng'wigeleelilwe kūpīnīhala, na kūnkīndīka ū munhū ūyo wagwītile ū mhayo gwenūyo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene ng'hana ī chene ū mu mīlī natī hamò ning'we ū kwenūko, alīyo ū mu moyo nalī hamò ning'we; hūna lūūlū ū munhū ūyo wagwītile ū mhayo gwenūyo naamalile kūnamula gītī gīkī nalī hamò ning'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo gwenūyo gwigasījagi hamò mu lina lya ng'wa Seeba Yesu, nū nene nakūbiza ning'we ū mu moyo, nū būdūla bo ng'wa Seeba wise ū Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ūyo alī gīko ntūūlagi kūlī Shetani, gūkenaagūlwe ū mīlī gwa shibi, ū moyo gūlapījiwe ū mu lūshikū lo ng'wa Seeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wikumīlīja wing'we būtī būsoga; mutamanile gīkī ī shibimbya nūūlū shikabiza shigehu na ginehe shikadudumyaga būsu h'ūmo būkwīlīle ūlū shūlubanījiwa mo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shīnjagi ī shibimbya sha kale, mubize būsu būpya būlubilwe, ūbo būtaalī kūduduma. Nguno ū Kilisito, ūyo alī pasaka yise wamalile kūfunyiwa kūbiza shitambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū tūshiyegelagi ī shigukulu; gwike ītī mu shibimbya sha kale, nūūlū sha būkenaagūji na būbi; alīyo mu būtūbiza na shibimbya, mu ng'hana na mu būtūngīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naalī nang'wandīkīlile nyalūba ya kūmuwīla gīkī, yaya ū kūbiza na būsangī nabo a bajingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natamuwīlile mihayo ya bajingi ba mu sī, nūūlū bikūmvi, nūūlū banyeecha, nūūlū balamya ba shiikolile; nguno ūlū ng'wīta gīko, numho a bing'we īkūng'wigeleelwa kūsaama ū mu sī! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī haha nalīng'wandīkīla gīkī, yaya ū kūbiza na būsangī na munhū ose ose ūyo akwitanagwa ndūgū, alīyo ū kūnū njingi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Njingi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ū mu Bibilia ū būjingi nū būshihani shilī shibi sha mbika īmò, nū nsango gwa bika īmò (leng. Lūh 1; 6:9).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nūūlū ng'wikūmvi, nūūlū namya wa shiikolile. Nūūlū akabiza ndūkani, nūūlū nkolwa walwa, pyī nūūlū nyeecha, ū munhū ūyo alī gīko, yaya nūūlū kūlya nang'hwe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī ū nene nalī na nguno kī nago ū mhayo gwa kūbalamula abo balī hanze? Alīyo a bing'we, ītang'wigeleelilwe ū kūbalamula abo balī mu kaya? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno abo balī hanze akūbalamula Mulungu, a bing'we nsūngūlagi ū wabūbi mung'wīnje ū mu bing'we.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
